    "Yaagl adds a marked section to /etc/hosts that sends the game's telemetry domains to 0.0.0.0. The game will not start without it. macOS asks for your administrator password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yaagl adds a marked section to /etc/hosts that sends the game's telemetry domains to 0.0.0.0. The game will not start without it. macOS asks for your administrator password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yaagl 会在 /etc/hosts 中加入一段带标记的内容，把游戏的遥测域名指向 0.0.0.0。没有它游戏无法启动。macOS 会要求输入管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
